WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.133
Turn your phone sideways. Tap More tools to find your trips, money, account, and help.

2
00:00:06.433 --> 00:00:09.633
Choose Trips to see the driving records saved on your phone.

3
00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:13.233
Tap Add manual trip to enter mileage from your records.

4
00:00:13.533 --> 00:00:18.200
Enter the distance you actually drove. This is a practice example.

5
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:25.733
Add a clear purpose so you can recognize this trip later.

6
00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:30.933
Open Classification and choose Business for a business trip.

7
00:00:31.233 --> 00:00:35.600
Scroll to earnings and enter the fare plus tips before platform fees.

8
00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:42.767
Enter the known platform fees. Use zero only when there were none.

9
00:00:43.067 --> 00:00:47.267
Review the details, then tap Save. Your trip appears in history.

10
00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:50.033
Tap Done to return to your Home dashboard.

11
00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:53.000
Tap Expense to record a purchase for your work.

12
00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:57.733
Type the merchant name. This fuel stop is a practice entry.

13
00:00:58.033 --> 00:01:04.633
Enter the amount from your receipt, then close the keyboard.

14
00:01:04.933 --> 00:01:09.800
Open Category and choose Fuel for this example.

15
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:14.700
Choose Business when the purchase was for your work.

16
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:18.400
Check the amount and category, then save your expense.

17
00:01:18.700 --> 00:01:21.433
Tap Offers to check a job before you decide.

18
00:01:21.733 --> 00:01:25.333
Open the guide to practice bringing a job screenshot into the app.

19
00:01:25.633 --> 00:01:28.733
First, tap Volume up in the practice picture.

20
00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:33.933
Tap the Side button, then Next. On your phone, press both buttons together.

21
00:01:34.233 --> 00:01:37.367
Tap the practice Save button to open the photo option.

22
00:01:37.667 --> 00:01:42.000
Choose Save to Photos, then continue to the import lesson.

23
00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:47.033
Choose the screenshot route to bring your picture into Gig Tax Pros.

24
00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:51.067
Tap the practice picture, then continue to review the numbers.

25
00:01:51.367 --> 00:01:56.067
Check the pay against the picture. Try changing this practice amount.

26
00:01:56.367 --> 00:02:00.067
Tap Check this job to see how the changed pay affects the estimate.

27
00:02:00.367 --> 00:02:04.000
Tap Done. The practice job was not saved to your records.

28
00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:08.267
Tap Earnings to see results from your saved driving records.

29
00:02:08.567 --> 00:02:11.700
Open Goals to set your own targets and vehicle cost.

30
00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:16.600
Enter your estimated vehicle cost per mile. Use costs that fit your vehicle.

31
00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:25.400
Enter your target net pay per driving hour, then close the keyboard.

32
00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:29.533
Save your goals. Earnings now uses the vehicle cost you entered.

33
00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:33.033
Tap Go Home to plan your destination and finish time.

34
00:02:33.333 --> 00:02:38.600
Enter the net earnings you want to work toward during this shift.

35
00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:42.400
Check the finish time and destination, then save your mission.

36
00:02:42.700 --> 00:02:46.633
Tap Position to explore waiting areas using your saved job history.

37
00:02:46.933 --> 00:02:51.033
Type the place you want to finish near before requesting route comparisons.

38
00:02:51.333 --> 00:02:57.233
Tap Home to open the tools for your records and goals.

39
00:02:57.533 --> 00:03:00.267
Tap the chat icon to open Tax and Goals.

40
00:03:00.567 --> 00:03:04.800
Open Tax details to review information you choose to share with your team.

41
00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:08.667
Cancel this practice form, then return to Home.

42
00:03:08.967 --> 00:03:13.133
Open More tools and choose Ratings and reviews.

43
00:03:13.433 --> 00:03:16.200
Tap Add rating to record a score from your gig app.

44
00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:21.433
Enter the score you saw. We are using a practice rating.

45
00:03:21.733 --> 00:03:25.367
Save the snapshot to your own history, then return to Home.

46
00:03:25.667 --> 00:03:29.667
Open More tools and choose Account to find your sign-in options.

47
00:03:29.967 --> 00:03:34.300
Expand the workspace address option if your firm supplied a sign-in address.

48
00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:38.400
Scroll to App privacy and data to review what stays on your phone.

49
00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:42.200
Go back, then tap Done to return to your Home dashboard.

50
00:03:42.500 --> 00:03:45.700
Tap Find an office and get help to open the office map.

51
00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:50.633
Enter your ZIP code, then close the keyboard to search for nearby offices.

52
00:03:50.933 --> 00:03:56.133
Tap Search. Available offices and contact options will appear here.

53
00:03:56.433 --> 00:03:59.400
Tap Back to return to Home and choose your next step.

54
00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:04.033
Open the sample shift to explore example earnings separately from your records.
